<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Specialty chemical firms started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Specialty chemical firms started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said analyst Robert Ottenstein initiated coverage of the specialty chemicals industry.</p>
<p>-- said six companies were started with attractive ratings, including Air Products and Chemicals Inc, Ecolab Inc, Ferro Corp, Morton International Inc, Nalco Chemical Co and Praxair Inc.  </p>
<p>-- said the following companies were started with neutral ratings: A. Schulman Inc, BetzDearborn Inc, Crompton &amp; Knowles Corp, Ethyl Corp, Great Lakes Chemical Corp, Lubrizol Corp, M.A. Hanna Co and Millipore Corp.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
